B.Rn=new A.aJ(B.z,B.X,1,"F and J: Anchor Keys","Place your index fingers on F and J \u2014 the two keys with small bumps.","ff jjj jfj fff jff ff ff fff jfj fff ff jjf jjj fjf jfj ffj fj fjf jjj jfj fjf fff fff jjj fff fff jjj jj jjj fff",90,0,"Stage 1 \xb7 Home Row","fj","Left index: F \xb7 Right index: J","Feel the small bumps on F and J. Rest your index fingers there and your thumbs on the space bar. Sit straight, keep your wrists relaxed and your eyes on the screen, not the keyboard.")
B.Rl=new A.aJ(B.z,B.X,2,"D and K: Middle Fingers","Add your middle fingers: D (left) and K (right).","df ddd fd jkj kf jk ddd dd dfd kj jkk dkd kjk kkj ddd kkk kfk jkk dd ddf ddd jdd dj dd dd kd fd dd kdk kkk jk dk",90,0,"Stage 1 \xb7 Home Row","dk","Left middle: D \xb7 Right middle: K","Keep F and J anchored. Lift only the finger that types, then bring it back to its home key.")
B.RR=new A.aJ(B.z,B.X,3,"S and L: Ring Fingers","Add your ring fingers: S (left) and L (right).","sss lfl jll llk jsj sl lsl kl ls sss dl lll lsl fss sl sl sl ks fs ll ls sss lf jl llk ssk lsl fl lll sds dll llf",90,0,"Stage 1 \xb7 Home Row","sl","Left ring: S \xb7 Right ring: L","Ring fingers are weaker \u2014 go slowly and focus on accuracy, not speed.")
B.Rk=new A.aJ(B.z,B.X,4,"A and ; : Little Fingers","Add your little fingers: A (left) and semicolon (right).","faa ;; kak j;j ;; ;;f ;; l;; ;s ;a; f;f ;;; k; ;; aa aak ;l fa ;a ;;; ;a aaa aa ;; d;; a;a l; a;a ;;; ;;; afa ;a;",90,0,"Stage 1 \xb7 Home Row","a;","Left little: A \xb7 Right little: ;","Your home row is now complete: A S D F (left) and J K L ; (right).")
B.Ra=new A.aJ(B.z,B.X,5,"G and H: Index Stretch","Stretch your index fingers sideways to G (left) and H (right).","hah gg fh agg hg gh hh gg ghg fg kh gg hhh hj hh hh kh kg agg ggg khk hhh ah kgk ghg hgh dgg dhh gg gjg hha ghg",90,0,"Stage 1 \xb7 Home Row","gh","Left index: G \xb7 Right index: H","Stretch the index finger sideways, then return it to F or J straight away.")
B.Ri=new A.aJ(B.z,B.X,6,"Home Row Words","Real words made only from home row letters.","ask dad sad lad gas has had fall hall glad flag half flash slash salad flask shall lass dash gash hash lash all ash add fads lads jags",90,0,"Stage 1 \xb7 Home Row","","All eight fingers on the home row","Keep all fingers resting on A S D F and J K L ; and return to them after every key.")
B.Rf=new A.aJ(B.z,B.X,7,"Home Row Review","Short phrases to lock in the home row.","a sad lad; a glad dad; ask dad; all fall; has a flask; had a salad; half a flag; a glass; a dash; a flask; a lass has a gas flask; dad had a salad; ask a lad;",90,0,"Stage 1 \xb7 Home Row","","All eight fingers on the home row","Do not look down. If you lose your place, find the bumps on F and J again.")
B.Ry=new A.aJ(B.z,B.X,8,"E and I: Reach Up","Reach up with your middle fingers to E (left) and I (right).","ee e;e iii jij ;e; ij iei fii iii eie eee iii eel ee; fi iii ee eel jij side like life lie die kid ill sell feel seed fled dies hide isle alike self kiss skill shed heal lead idea",90,0,"Stage 2 \xb7 Top Row","ei","Left middle: E \xb7 Right middle: I","Reach up from D and K, then return to the home row. The other fingers stay in place.")
B.Rr=new A.aJ(B.z,B.X,9,"R and U: Index Fingers Up","Reach up with your index fingers to R (left) and U (right).","uuj rr uru jr srs ur rrr uu ur rrl rrr srs rrr uhu uuu rrr huu uu rd rr rude ruled user dark lurk sure hurdle fur rug jug hug rush real raised rid ride rural surf slur lure sulk",90,0,"Stage 2 \xb7 Top Row","ru","Left index: R \xb7 Right index: U",u.v)
B.RC=new A.aJ(B.z,B.X,10,"T and Y: Index Stretch Up","Stretch your index fingers to T (left) and Y (right).","yt tt ttj tkt yyy yty lt yy yt yys ftt ete tt tyt ttt yl yyy ti ty yyl that they tall study dusty stay yet tray style turtle tail fifty guilty hasty yard duty tidy lately daily safety thirsty",90,0,"Stage 2 \xb7 Top Row","ty","Left index: T \xb7 Right index: Y","Use the same index finger that types R or U \u2014 just stretch it one key further.")
B.RN=new A.aJ(B.z,B.X,11,"W and O: Ring Fingers Up","Reach up with your ring fingers to W (left) and O (right).","oo ewe eoe hww oo ww owo ww wow joo sw owo ow ww awa jw wwj www lwl wo word wood low slow those wolf follow show would hello wall wide owl glow owe row work world worth throw tow",90,0,"Stage 2 \xb7 Top Row","wo","Left ring: W \xb7 Right ring: O","Ring fingers need practice. Slow and accurate is better than fast and wrong.")
B.Rw=new A.aJ(B.z,B.X,12,"Q and P: Little Fingers Up","Reach up with your little fingers to Q (left) and P (right).","qqq qtq sps ppp qp ppp pph pgp qq qqq pk pp kp qsq pq qqq qfq iq ppk qp quiet quote puppy paper pour quite queue equal pilot spoil power pure quirk upper happy please pull page quilt",90,0,"Stage 2 \xb7 Top Row","qp","Left little: Q \xb7 Right little: P","These are the farthest top-row keys. Keep your wrist steady and move only your finger.")
B.QA=new A.aJ(B.z,B.X,13,"Top Row Words",u.F,"quiet write your tree pretty wire quote type require water flower tired paper surely rough she wrote her poetry; the poet felt tired; a quiet lad kept the key",90,0,"Stage 2 \xb7 Top Row","","All eight fingers","Say each word in your head while you type it. It helps your fingers remember.")
B.QC=new A.aJ(B.z,B.X,14,"Top Row Review","More top row and home row practice.","a quiet lad kept the key; she poured the water; his paper fell; the pilot wrote her letter; where were those flowers; you should rest; sure; hold the rope; she tried to skip the trail; ",90,0,"Stage 2 \xb7 Top Row","","All eight fingers","Try to keep a steady rhythm: the same speed for every key.")
B.QP=new A.aJ(B.z,B.X,15,"V and M: Index Fingers Down","Reach down with your index fingers to V (left) and M (right).","tmt vwv vvv ovv vvt vv vvv vev v;v vvt mm kmk mmm mvm mma vv move mild milk mad mud very ever over live love gave have drive more some time same make like",90,0,"Stage 3 \xb7 Bottom Row","vm","Left index: V \xb7 Right index: M","V is below F and M is below J. Curl your finger down and back up.")
B.QQ=new A.aJ(B.z,B.X,16,"C and Comma: Middle Fingers Down","Reach down with your middle fingers to C (left) and comma (right).","m,m ,, ,,l ,, ,c ,,, ccw ,, dc m, pcp cc pc p, ccj i,, ,,, ci cat, cut, cup, cry, cure, circle, clock, check, cloud, face, price, voice, music, place,",90,0,"Stage 3 \xb7 Bottom Row","c,","Left middle: C \xb7 Right middle: , (comma)","C is below D and the comma is below K.")
B.R4=new A.aJ(B.z,B.X,17,"X and Period: Ring Fingers Down","Reach down with your ring fingers to X (left) and period (right).","..m xx xx ax xx txx .l xxx ..u ... ... mxx .x. xl ... .q. jxx six. fix. mix. exit. extra. expect. fox. tax. relax. exam. excuse. taxi. wax.",90,0,"Stage 3 \xb7 Bottom Row","x.","Left ring: X \xb7 Right ring: . (period)","X is below S and the period is below L.")
B.RO=new A.aJ(B.z,B.X,18,"Z and Slash: Little Fingers Down","Reach down with your little fingers to Z (left) and slash (right).","lzz // //t // /e //. zzo //a zp zzz /q/ zzz f// /l/ /z/ /z // zoo zip zero size maze quiz lazy crazy puzzle froze",90,0,"Stage 3 \xb7 Bottom Row","z/","Left little: Z \xb7 Right little: / (slash)","These are the hardest bottom-row keys. Take your time.")
B.Ro=new A.aJ(B.z,B.X,19,"B and N: Index Stretch Down","Stretch your index fingers down to B (left) and N (right).","wbb bb /bb nf ln nnn nnn nqn ndn nq nn bn ;b; nb bn rnr obo bnb bin ban bun bone bunny number never between brown bank band blank nine nobody",90,0,"Stage 3 \xb7 Bottom Row","bn","Left index: B \xb7 Right index: N","B belongs to your left index finger and N to your right index finger. Now you know every letter!")
B.RL=new A.aJ(B.z,B.X,20,"Bottom Row Words","Words that use the bottom row keys.","zoom mix van cab mob nab exam mean man can vex zoom van cabin canvas mountain number zebra maybe vanish combine movie, banana, cinema.",90,0,"Stage 3 \xb7 Bottom Row","","All eight fingers","Go back to the home row after every key.")
B.QW=new A.aJ(B.z,B.X,21,"Full Alphabet Review","Sentences that use every letter of the alphabet.","the quick brown fox jumps over the lazy dog. pack my box with five dozen liquor jugs. how vexingly quick daft zebras jump. sphinx of black quartz, judge my vow.",90,0,"Stage 3 \xb7 Bottom Row","","All eight fingers","You now know the whole alphabet. Next: capital letters with the Shift key.")
B.a9=new A.lr(1,"intermediate")
B.R7=new A.aJ(B.z,B.a9,22,"Shift: Left-Hand Capitals","Hold the right Shift with your right little finger for left-hand capitals.","Asad Sara Zara Bilal Faraz Ghazala Tariq Waqar Rabia Sadia Ejaz Danish Farah Zeeshan Waleed Rashid Taimur Saad Fatima Zainab Aisha Bushra",90,0,"Stage 4 \xb7 Shift & Punctuation","","Right little: Shift (for A S D F G Q W E R T Z X C V B)","When the letter is typed by your LEFT hand, hold the RIGHT Shift. Press Shift, tap the letter, then release both.")
B.RP=new A.aJ(B.z,B.a9,23,"Shift: Right-Hand Capitals","Hold the left Shift with your left little finger for right-hand capitals.","Hamza Imran Javed Kamran Naveed Omar Usman Yasir Parveen Lubna Maryam Hina Noman Iqra Uzma Kashif Ismail Majid Hafsa Nadia Yusuf Owais Lahore Multan Karachi Peshawar Islamabad",90,0,"Stage 4 \xb7 Shift & Punctuation","","Left little: Shift (for Y U I O P H J K L N M)","When the letter is typed by your RIGHT hand, hold the LEFT Shift.")
B.QE=new A.aJ(B.z,B.a9,24,"Capitals in Sentences","Start every sentence with a capital letter.","Ali is in Lahore. Sara went to Multan. Hamza and Omar play in Karachi. Zara likes the park. Bilal made a quiet plan. Maryam wrote a long letter. Usman lives near Islamabad.",90,0,"Stage 4 \xb7 Shift & Punctuation","","Both Shift keys, both little fingers",u.J)
B.RD=new A.aJ(B.z,B.a9,25,"Question and Exclamation","Type ? and ! with Shift.","Why? How? Who? What? When? Where? Wow! Yes! Stop! Look! Where is Ali? He is in Lahore! What time is it? Please wait! How are you? Great job!",90,0,"Stage 4 \xb7 Shift & Punctuation","?!","? is Shift + / (right little) \xb7 ! is Shift + 1 (left little)","For ? hold the LEFT Shift and press / with your right little finger. For ! hold the RIGHT Shift and press 1 with your left little finger.")
B.R9=new A.aJ(B.z,B.a9,26,"Apostrophe and Quotes","Type ' and \" correctly.","it's don't I'm she's can't they're we'll \"Hello,\" said Ali. \"Come in,\" said Sara. \"Thank you,\" I said. Don't forget the \"quotes\" and it's done.",90,0,"Stage 4 \xb7 Shift & Punctuation","'\"","Right little finger: ' (and Shift + ' for \")","The apostrophe is next to the semicolon. Hold the LEFT Shift for the double quote.")
B.QU=new A.aJ(B.z,B.a9,27,"Colon and Hyphen","Type : with Shift and - with your right little finger.","Note: Task: Goal: Step: Rule: well-known long-term self-made full-time one-way check-in Name: Ali. Plan: well-made. Tip: take a long-term view.",90,0,"Stage 4 \xb7 Shift & Punctuation",":-","Right little: : (Shift + ;) and - (hyphen)","Colon is Shift + semicolon. Hyphen is on the number row, to the right of 0.")
B.Rc=new A.aJ(B.z,B.a9,28,"Numbers 4 and 7","Reach up with your index fingers to 4 (left) and 7 (right).","l4 7j7 44 77 44 7s7 4s4 74 4f4 4k4 44 747 f4f 7j 4d 7d7 77 4f4 444 77j 4d 47 4k l4l j44 k4k 47 k44 77 f7 44 j77 47 7j s4 77 77 77 777 l7 44 77 74 d7d 777",90,0,"Stage 5 \xb7 Number Row","47","Left index: 4 \xb7 Right index: 7","4 is above R and 7 is above U. Return to the home row after every number.")
B.RG=new A.aJ(B.z,B.a9,29,"Numbers 3 and 8","Reach up with your middle fingers to 3 (left) and 8 (right).","333 j88 383 d3d 888 888 f33 88 888 88 383 884 l3 334 8j8 48 k3 333 34 33l 38 33 83 8j8 373 333 38 83 83 3k 3s3 333 k3 88 383 33 888 33 33 333 788 383 787",90,0,"Stage 5 \xb7 Number Row","38","Left middle: 3 \xb7 Right middle: 8","3 is above E and 8 is above I.")
B.R_=new A.aJ(B.z,B.a9,30,"Numbers 2 and 9","Reach up with your ring fingers to 2 (left) and 9 (right).","999 494 292 999 92 f9f 999 222 28 99 999 29 92 22 98 s2s 999 999 2k 22 99f 99 k22 2j 292 2s2 292 323 22 9f9 999 k9k 999 22 322 99d 322 232 9f d99 29 j9",90,0,"Stage 5 \xb7 Number Row","29","Left ring: 2 \xb7 Right ring: 9","2 is above W and 9 is above O.")
B.QT=new A.aJ(B.z,B.a9,31,"Numbers 1 and 0","Reach up with your little fingers to 1 (left) and 0 (right).","10 112 111 711 11 000 101 10 0k 01 111 00 10 00k 010 11j 11l 010 07 d00 0k 711 00 l11 030 000 00 008 11 20 70 00 070 11 01 11 311 0d 01 818 00s 20 01 11",90,0,"Stage 5 \xb7 Number Row","10","Left little: 1 \xb7 Right little: 0","1 is above Q and 0 is above P. These are the farthest keys \u2014 go slowly.")
B.R8=new A.aJ(B.z,B.a9,32,"Numbers 5 and 6","Stretch your index fingers to 5 (left) and 6 (right).","565 66 666 555 63 662 54 585 555 55 555 646 6f6 f6 6f6 555 65 55 5d 555 6s 676 64 54 55 56 f6f 55 j6 656 555 55 65 j55 55 666 66 f6f 65 55 57 57 l6 55f",90,0,"Stage 5 \xb7 Number Row","56","Left index: 5 \xb7 Right index: 6","5 is above T and 6 is above Y.")
B.RA=new A.aJ(B.z,B.a9,33,"Numbers Review","All ten digits together.","1234567890 0987654321 1357924680 2468013579 1029384756 5647382910 1111 2222 3333 4444 5555 6666 7777 8888 9999 0000 12 34 56 78 90",90,0,"Stage 5 \xb7 Number Row","","All eight fingers","Say each number out loud in your head as you type it.")
B.Qv=new A.aJ(B.z,B.a9,34,"Numbers in Sentences","Letters, numbers and punctuation together.","Room 204, Floor 3. I have 3 cats and 12 chicks. The year is 2026. Dial 042 1234567. Page 45, line 18. Bus 7 leaves at 9:30. We sold 150 books on day 1.",90,0,"Stage 5 \xb7 Number Row","","All eight fingers",u.X)
B.QV=new A.aJ(B.z,B.a9,35,"Email and Web Symbols","Type @ _ and web addresses.","ali@mail.com sara_khan@mail.com www.example.com https://example.com/home user_name_2026 zara-ahmed@mail.com shop.example.com/book_list",90,0,"Stage 6 \xb7 Symbols","@_","@ is Shift + 2 (left ring) \xb7 _ is Shift + - (right little)","Use the opposite-side Shift. @ uses the RIGHT Shift. Underscore uses the LEFT Shift.")
B.RK=new A.aJ(B.z,B.a9,36,"Money and Math Symbols","Type $ % + = * and /.","Price: $25 + $15 = $40. 50% of 200 is 100. 8 * 7 = 56. 9 / 3 = 3. Total: $120 - $20 = $100. Save 10% today.",90,0,"Stage 6 \xb7 Symbols","$%+=*","$ % + = * all use Shift (+ number key) \u2014 use the opposite-side Shift","$ is Shift + 4, % is Shift + 5, * is Shift + 8, + is Shift + =. Equal sign is next to the hyphen.")
B.QR=new A.aJ(B.z,B.a9,37,"Brackets and Other Symbols","Type ( ) [ ] { } < > & #.","(one) [two] {three} <four> a & b #tag (a + b) * [c - d] = {e} if (x > 5) { y = 1; } Q&A #1 <b>bold</b>",90,0,"Stage 6 \xb7 Symbols","()[]{}<>&#","Shift + 9 and 0 for ( ) \xb7 [ ] { } are next to P \xb7 < > are Shift + , and .","Brackets sit near your right little finger. Take it slowly and use the opposite-side Shift.")
B.QN=new A.aJ(B.z,B.a9,38,"Common English Words","The words you will type most often.","the and for you are with his they have this from that not but what all were when your can said there use each which she how their will other about out many then them these some her would make like him into time has look two more write see number way could people my than first water been call who oil its now find long down day did get come made may part",90,0,"Stage 7 \xb7 Words & Sentences","","All ten fingers",u.D)
B.QY=new A.aJ(B.z,B.a9,39,"Short Sentences","Short, natural sentences.","The sun is bright today. We went to the market. She reads a book every night. Please close the door. My brother plays cricket. The tea is hot. Tomorrow we will visit the park.",90,0,"Stage 7 \xb7 Words & Sentences","","All ten fingers","Press Space with your thumb. Try to keep an even rhythm.")
B.R1=new A.aJ(B.z,B.a9,40,"Longer Sentences","Longer sentences with commas and periods.","When the rain stopped, we walked to the old bridge, and the whole city looked fresh and quiet. Although it was late, Ali finished his work, checked it twice, and then went home.",90,0,"Stage 7 \xb7 Words & Sentences","","All ten fingers","Commas and periods are part of the rhythm \u2014 do not skip them.")
B.QD=new A.aJ(B.z,B.a9,41,"Paragraph Practice",u.m,"Learning to type well takes patience. At first, your fingers feel slow and clumsy, but every day they remember a little more. After a few weeks, you will type without looking at the keys, and your speed will grow naturally.",90,0,"Stage 7 \xb7 Words & Sentences","","All ten fingers","Accuracy first. Speed comes by itself.")
B.cx=new A.lr(2,"advanced")
B.QB=new A.aJ(B.z,B.cx,42,"Accuracy Challenge","Type slowly and aim for 95% accuracy.",'Quietly, the quick zebra jumped over six wooden boxes. Seven brave judges examined fifty-two huge frozen jars. "Why, exactly?" asked Ms. Vaz. Perfect practice makes progress.',95,0,"Stage 8 \xb7 Speed & Accuracy","","All ten fingers",u.s)
B.RI=new A.aJ(B.z,B.cx,43,"Speed Builder 1","Reach 15 WPM with at least 90% accuracy.","We like to walk by the river in the morning. The air is cool and the birds sing in the trees. After a short rest, we drink tea and talk about our day.",90,15,"Stage 8 \xb7 Speed & Accuracy","","All ten fingers","Target: 15 WPM. Keep your eyes on the screen.")
B.RF=new A.aJ(B.z,B.cx,44,"Speed Builder 2","Reach 20 WPM with at least 90% accuracy.","A good habit is built one day at a time. If you practise a little every day, your hands learn the path between the keys, and typing begins to feel as natural as walking.",90,20,"Stage 8 \xb7 Speed & Accuracy","","All ten fingers","Target: 20 WPM. Do not rush the hard words.")
B.RB=new A.aJ(B.z,B.cx,45,"Speed Builder 3","Reach 25 WPM with at least 90% accuracy.","The best way to improve is to relax your shoulders, breathe, and let your fingers do the work. Fast typists are not tense; they are smooth. Smooth leads to fast, and fast follows when you stay calm.",90,25,"Stage 8 \xb7 Speed & Accuracy","","All ten fingers","Target: 25 WPM. Smooth beats tense.")
B.QZ=new A.aJ(B.z,B.cx,46,"Final Test","Show what you have learned: 25 WPM and 95% accuracy.","Touch typing is a skill that stays with you for life. Today you have learned every key, every finger, and how to keep a steady rhythm. Keep practising, keep your accuracy high, and your speed will continue to grow week after week.",95,25,"Stage 8 \xb7 Speed & Accuracy","","All ten fingers",u.W)
